{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269GE3K6Jxr51793023629.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>衞生署採購予半歲至11歲兒童接種的新冠疫苗已抵港，周四起可接種。</p><p></p><p>疫苗聯合科學委員會早前建議，本年度選用LP.8.1、XFG或NB.1.8.1新冠疫苗，政府已採購相關針劑。周四起市民可為幼童網上預約，並到母嬰健康院、學生健康服務中心、兒童醫院或私家診所接種。6個月至4歲需接種兩劑，每劑間隔最少28天。5歲或以上只需接種一劑。</p><p></p><p>衞生防護中心表示，雖然新冠病毒已成常見的呼吸道傳染病，但部分高風險人士，尤其是幼童，一旦感染，有較高風險出現嚴重併發症。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:38.860144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:19.896553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:53.534043+00:00","content_hash":"84e5ebc946235a4d4bb6e58371457b458f7744c19be1404ccabb6d9068574d75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:38.860144+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}